msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"My daughter is getting to that age... I'd sure like to see her get married "
"soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"But I want her to marry somebody with an honest job⑬not some crook like me. "
"She deserves a normal life..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"What about that guy⑬what's his name? Kohashi-kun? He's president of that "
"cell phone software company! I feel like he'd be a perfect fit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Kohashi...? Nah, he's no good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Huh? Why?"
msgstr "Eh? Perché?"

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"That company's one of the fronts for the Hakuho Clan. It may look legit, but"
" it's totally run by the yakuza."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"You mean Kohashi's working for Mine? Wow, I had no idea.\r\n"
"I guess you really can't judge a book by its cover, huh?"
msgstr ""

